[1m[38;5;231mWhich tooling should I set up from the start?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [ ] [38;5;153mUnit tests[39m
  [38;5;246mVitest + a first passing test for categorize(). Recommended — the pure reminder logic is exactly what unit tests are [39m
  [38;5;246mfor.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Lint + format
  [38;5;246mESLint + Prettier on defaults, run on the whole tree. Recommended — near-free before there's code.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright driving a real browser. Real cost; probably overkill at this size.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] None — keep it bare
